{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Dear friends in Christ, here in the presence of Almighty God, \softline
let us kneel in silence, and with penitent and obedient hearts \softline
confess our sins, so that we may obtain forgiveness by his \softline
infinite goodness and mercy. \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 or this}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let us confess our sins against God and our neighbor. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Silence may be kept.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Officiant and People together, all kneeling}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Most merciful God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we confess that we have sinned against you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in thought, word, and deed,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 by what we have done,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and by what we have left undone.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 We have not loved you with our whole heart;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we have not loved our neighbors as ourselves.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 We are truly sorry and we humbly repent.\par
}\column 
\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 For the sake of your Son Jesus Christ,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 have mercy on us and forgive us;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that we may delight in your will,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and walk in your ways,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to the glory of your Name.  Amen. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Priest alone stands and says}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God have mercy on you, forgive you all your sins\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 through our Lord Jesus Christ, strengthen you in all\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 goodness, and by the power of the Holy Spirit keep you in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 eternal life.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
