}{\plain \fs24 \f3 thank you for the blessings of the day that is past, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 humbly ask for your protection through the coming night.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Bring us in safety to the morning hours; through him who\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 died and rose again for us, your Son our Savior Jesus Christ.\par
