{\plain \fs24 \f3 Lord Jesus, stay with us, for evening is at hand and the day\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 is past; be our companion in the way, kindle our hearts, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 awaken hope, that we may know you as you are revealed in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Scripture and the breaking of bread.  Grant this for the sake\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of your love.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
