}{\plain \fs24 \f3 all tongues confess and bless you, and men and women\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 everywhere love you and serve you in peace; through Jesus\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Christ our Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
