{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God, Father of all mercies,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we your unworthy servants give you humble thanks\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 for all your goodness and loving-kindness\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to us and to all whom you have made.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 We bless you for our creation, preservation,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and all the blessings of this life;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 but above all for your immeasurable love\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in the redemption of the world by our Lord Jesus Christ;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 for the means of grace, and for the hope of glory.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 And, we pray, give us such an awareness of your mercies,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that with truly thankful hearts we may show forth your praise,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 not only with our lips, but in our lives,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 by giving up our selves to your service,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and by walking before you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in holiness and righteousness all our days;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 through Jesus Christ our Lord,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to whom, with you and the Holy Spirit,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 be honor and glory throughout all ages.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
